//! Raw JPEG 2000 and HTJ2K codestream boundary.
//!
//! This crate owns marker parsing, tile/component state, packet progression,
//! and orchestration of transform and block-coding stages. It does not parse
//! JP2/JPH boxes. With `std`, optional positioned-read adapters expose raw
//! codestream files without moving filesystem policy into codec algorithms.

